hello everyone I'm Jason Johansen the  homicide Lieutenant with the Las Vegas  Metropolitan Police Department and I'm  here today to ask for the community's  assistance in solving the murder of  Graciela Gomez approximately one year  ago on Halloween weekend October 31st of  2021 Graciela Gomez was attending a  Halloween party in the 200 block of  Beasley drive while she's attending that  Halloween party it quickly began to get  out of hand as it was advertised on  social media as it began to get out of  hand several subjects were turned away  from the front entrance to the party and  returned their vehicle as that vehicle  drove away from the residents Southbound  on Beasley drive it fired numerous  gunshots into the front of the residence  unfortunately as a result of that  shooting  three people were struck Graciela Gomez  and two other females those two other  females thankfully suffered Now by  threatening injuries Graciela  unfortunately was transported to the  hospital and was later pronounced  deceased  today we are releasing video that we've  obtained as a result of our  investigation from the houses nearby  where the shooting occurred in this  video it shows the vehicle driving by  and shooting into the residence and  fleeing Southbound on Beasley Drive our  hopes is that by releasing this  information it will Garner somebody's  memory and someone will provide us a tip  that will lead to the identification of  those responsible for the shooting of  Graciela Gomez I urge anyone with any  information related to this  investigation to please contact Crime  Stoppers of Nevada or reach out to the  lvmpd homicide section your information  will remain anonymous and there is  reward money available thank you  foreign
 

